 "goal": {
  "id": "26/G",
  "goal": "Explain how human perception and proprioception arise from neural and motor processing, how XR sensory conflicts can cause cybersickness or presence loss, and state a design implication for reducing such conflicts.",
  "achieves": "Provides the human-factors foundation for evaluating XR experiences and addressing psycho-physiological issues in XR system development."
 },
